Returns the heat capacity rate for the minimum stream
having flows `mh` and `mc`, with averaged heat capacities `Cph` and `Cpc`.

.. math::
    C_c = m_cC_{p,c}

    C_h = m_h C_{p,h}

    C_{min} = \min(C_c, C_h)

Returns the spectral radiance, in units of W/m^2/sr/µm.

.. math::
    I_{\lambda,blackbody,e}(\lambda,T)=\frac{2hc_o^2}
    {\lambda^5[\exp(hc_o/\lambda k T)-1]}
